ns 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that middle sat at 172% in September to October and 63% in November to December. So far in 2026 it read 36% in January to February and 183% in May to June. Grid 21775 had its driest year in 1963 at 64%, and its preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 85.2.</p>"}
